&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;It has not been demonstrated that the materials used in
the facing flank elevations of the rear dormer, when viewed from ground level,
would appear to be of similar colour and design to the materials used in the
main roof of the subject dwellinghouse. The proposed dormer would not therefore
be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class B, Condition B.2 (a) of
The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order
2015 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;It has not been demonstrated that the edge of the
enlargement closest to the eaves of the original roof shall, so far as
practicable, be not less than 0.2 metres from the eaves, measured along the
roof slope from the outside edge of the eaves. The proposed dormer would not
therefore be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class B, Condition B (bb)
of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England)
Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;It has not been demonstrated that the two rooflights
in the front roof slope would not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt; protrude more than
0.15 metres beyond the plane of the slope of the original roof when measured
from the perpendicular with the external surface of the original roof&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-font-kerning:0pt;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;.
It would therefore not be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class C,
C1 (b)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The proposal is NOT therefore a lawful development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
